Branch: feature/tk-402-private-ai-payments

Implement shielded-to-x402 bridge - construct x402 payment using shielded balance withdrawal.

## The Core Challenge
x402 requires a signature from a wallet with funds. Shielded funds are not directly signable.

**Solution (based on tk-402.3 research)**:
1. Withdraw from shielded pool to **ephemeral keypair** (one-time use)
2. Use ephemeral keypair to sign x402 payment
3. Ephemeral keypair is discarded - no link to original wallet

## Implementation
```typescript
// spyk-sdk/src/x402/SpykX402Client.ts
import { Keypair } from '@solana/web3.js';
import { createClient } from 'x402-solana';

async payPrivately(invoice: X402Invoice): Promise<X402PaymentResult> {
  // 1. Generate ephemeral keypair (one-time use for privacy)
  const ephemeral = Keypair.generate();
  console.log('[SPYK] Ephemeral address:', ephemeral.publicKey.toBase58());

  // 2. Withdraw exact amount from shielded pool to ephemeral
  const withdrawAmount = this.calculateTotalNeeded(invoice); // amount + fees
  const withdrawTx = await this.privacyCash.withdrawTo(
    ephemeral.publicKey,
    withdrawAmount
  );
  console.log('[SPYK] Withdrawal tx:', withdrawTx);

  // 3. Wait for confirmation
  await this.connection.confirmTransaction(withdrawTx, 'confirmed');

  // 4. Create x402 payment using ephemeral signer
  const x402Client = createClient({
    connection: this.connection,
    payer: ephemeral,  // Ephemeral signs the payment
  });

  const paymentResult = await x402Client.pay({
    amount: invoice.amount,
    token: invoice.token,
    recipient: invoice.recipient,
    memo: invoice.memo,
  });

  // 5. Return any dust back to shielded pool (optional, for cleanliness)
  // await this.sweepDustToShielded(ephemeral);

  return {
    signature: paymentResult.signature,
    isPrivate: true,  // Payment came from ephemeral, not main wallet
    ephemeralUsed: ephemeral.publicKey.toBase58(),
  };
}

private calculateTotalNeeded(invoice: X402Invoice): number {
  const amount = parseFloat(invoice.amount);
  const estimatedFees = 0.001; // ~5000 lamports for tx fees
  return amount + estimatedFees;
}
```

## Key Privacy Property
- On-chain: Only the ephemeral address appears
- The withdrawal from shielded pool is private (no link to original wallet)
- Ephemeral keypair is generated fresh each payment
- No way to link multiple payments to same user

## Edge Cases to Handle
- Insufficient shielded balance → throw clear error
- Withdrawal fails → don't proceed to payment
- Payment fails after withdrawal → funds stuck in ephemeral (document recovery)

## Files to modify
- spyk-sdk/src/x402/SpykX402Client.ts
- spyk-sdk/src/x402/types.ts (add ephemeralUsed to result type)

## Done When
Can call `client.payPrivately(invoice)` and:
1. See withdrawal from shielded pool
2. See payment from ephemeral address on Solscan
3. Original wallet address NOT visible in payment flow

